RF Deep Dig licensing
=====================

This repository contains material under different terms.

1. FriendSDK and third-party material

FriendSDK source, including the runtime in src/, is licensed under Apache-2.0.
See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt. Third-party code, artwork and fonts retain their
own terms regardless of location. See NOTICE.md and
games/deep-dig/fonts/Silkscreen-OFL.txt.

2. Deep Dig material

New original Deep Dig contributions introduced under these terms, for which
chimph holds the relevant rights, are covered by
LICENSES/Deep-Dig-Evaluation.txt unless explicitly licensed otherwise.
This includes original game code, game assets, game-specific tooling,
tests and documentation. It excludes FriendSDK runtime code, third-party
material and anything separately licensed. For mixed files, the evaluation
terms apply only to the original contributions covered by those terms.
Nothing in these terms limits permissions available under another applicable
licence or rights granted by law.

The evaluation terms allow inspection, private testing and judging, but
require separate permission for commercial reuse or public hosting of
covered material. They are source-available terms, not an open-source licence.

3. Contact and ownership

Builder: chimph. Contact: https://x.com/intocryptoast
No ownership transfer, exclusivity or official Rare Friends endorsement is
created by publishing this repository or making it available for evaluation.
No rights in third-party names or trademarks are granted by these terms.
